SUMMARY:Saturday Night with Friends! (Dinner\, Live Music and Dancing)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nPlease join
  us for a great evening as we mix\, mingle\, make new friends\, dinner par
 ty and dance the night away with a fabulous Live Band!\n\n\\*Joined by my 
 other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lo
 ts of friendly peers to enjoy dinner and the game\n\n**\\*Meet us inside S
 moke Show between 6:00 pm and 8:00 pm**\n\\*If you have to arrive after th
 at\, still let the front door guy know you are with Steve's group so he ca
 n direct you to us (but kindly do your best to arrive between 6:00 pm and 
 7:30 pm (as I can't promise seating after that)-Thank you!\n\n(Event Detai
 ls Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Det
 ails:\n**Saturday Night with Friends! (Dinner\, Live Music and Dancing)**\
 n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food\, reserved seating\, L
 ive Band and Dancing!\n-Pool Table available\n-Plenty of parking all aroun
 d the venue and very close to Mt. Pleasant Station\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 d
 ollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer in adv
 ance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n(O
 ne Beverage or Appetizer Minimum please)\n\n**-Arrive any time between 6:0
 0 pm and 8:00 pm inside the restaurant (ask or look for Steve/Organizer wh
 en you arrive)**\n\\*If arriving after 8:00 you still need to let the guy 
 at the front door know you are with Steve's group so he can properly direc
 t you to us and help track our numbers- Thank you for your kind co-operati
 on!\n\n(1 minute walk from the new Mt. Pleasant & Eglinton station)
